WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:07.510
CLIP (Contrastive Language-Image Pre-Training) is a neural network trained on a variety of (image, text) pairs

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:13.750
It can be instructed in natural language to predict the most relevant text snippet

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.760
clip/clip.py: defines tokenize

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:21.980
clip/model.py: defines build_model

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:26.400
load: loads a CLIP model

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:32.230
Install: pip install ftfy regex tqdm

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:40.270
Pipeline Fit: general tool

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:46.940
It can be instructed in natural language to predict the most relevant text snippet

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.580
